  "description": "The Cutthroat C Rival GX AXS Transmission SUS is a carbon bikepacking bike designed for the roughest routes. We designed it to thrive on the mixed terrain and long miles that riders experience on the Tour Divide: its lightweight carbon fiber frame features our Class 5™ VRS (vibration reduction system) to soak up road chatter, and our drop-bar mountain bike geometry puts you in a confident, comfortable riding position. We’ve equipped this Cutthroat with a 100mm suspension fork for extra stability and control. Cargo mounts on the frame give you plenty of space for your supplies and shelter. The SRAM Rival - GX AXS Transmission drivetrain delivers smooth, effortless shifting and massive gear range.",
